[TITLE]
NUM-50: STEADY routing, one conduit J1 -> C1 -> O1 carrying 1 cfs of clean
dry-weather flow. The test adds an API pollutant mass flux to C1.
J1 is node 0 and C1 is link 0, so CRASH-12's index mix-up has no effect here.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         STEADY
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             02:00:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         60
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J1     10   5   0   0   0

[OUTFALLS]
O1   5   FREE

[CONDUITS]
C1  J1  O1  400  0.013  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1  CIRCULAR  1.5  0  0  0  1

[POLLUTANTS]
;;Name Units Crain Cgw Crdii Kdecay SnowOnly CoPollut CoFrac Cdwf Cinit
P1  MG/L  0  0  0  0  NO  *  0  0  0

[DWF]
J1  FLOW  1.0
J1  P1    0

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
